Chromium 159.0.8154.11 + the later changes of its release branch, up to
3b4071105e68997ea7beb5e2a38be9e3f7aad68e (refs/branch-heads/8154@{#533}), for the
159.0.8154.11 tree that chromium-159.0.8154.6-to-159.0.8154.11.patch makes.

Generated from the upstream diff chromium/src refs/tags/159.0.8154.11..3b4071105e68997ea7beb5e2a38be9e3f7aad68e
(no dependency's DEPS revision changed), as served by Gitiles, with
scripts/chromium-delta --branch-fixes (against the .11 tree's files): left out
are files not in the release tarball, iOS/Android/ChromeOS/Mac/Windows-only
files, tests and docs, translations other than en-GB, PGO/orderfile pointers.
chrome/VERSION, the DEPS files and the stamp files stay at 159.0.8154.11.

Commits contributing to it (oldest first):
  3b4071105e68 [M159] [blink] Clear background streamer on script revalidation
  278dc908fd90 [M159] WebUI: Format Lit templates in NTP and lens directories
  b1a06ed1f8e0 [M159] [Contextual Tasks] Restrict Contextual Tasks UI to Desktop Android

Checked: applies to the 159.0.8154.11 tree; every patched file is
byte-identical to its version at the commit above; it adds 4 files
(.style.lit_template_formatter, Lit template formatter configurations).

